   "he": "וְאָמַר מוּתָּרִין הֵם. מוּתָּרִין לְמַאי? רַב אָמַר: מוּתָּרִין לְקַבֵּל. וְלֵוִי אָמַר: מוּתָּרִין בַּאֲכִילָה.",
   "en": "§ It was stated in the mishna that Rabban Gamliel «said» that the fish brought to him on the Festival by the gentile «are permitted.» The Gemara asks: «Permitted for what» purpose? «Rav said: They are permitted to be received» and moved, but they may not be eaten. «Levi said: They are» even «permitted to be eaten.»"
  }
